Package: vdr-plugin-ohpvstatus
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${vdr:Depends}
Description: VDR plugin to display openHAB PV and energy status
 Displays real-time energy data from an openHAB installation in the VDR
 OSD: PV production, house consumption, battery charge/discharge, battery
 state of charge (with bar) and grid import/export. Host, port and items
 are set in /etc/vdr/conf.avail/ohpvstatus.conf, display options in the
 VDR setup menu.
